WEBVTT

00:00:22.710 --> 00:00:25.910
You're more of a friend to me
than anyone I knew.

00:00:26.110 --> 00:00:28.510
Your power, beauty...

00:00:29.710 --> 00:00:32.650
I envied you almost as much
as I respected you.

00:00:32.850 --> 00:00:35.040
Why someone like you...

00:00:35.250 --> 00:00:39.190
...and your soul need
to be tied down...

00:00:39.390 --> 00:00:41.790
...to such a remote island country.

00:00:42.760 --> 00:00:44.730
My friend, Larva.

00:00:53.500 --> 00:00:55.990
Don't you recognize my voice?

00:00:56.210 --> 00:01:01.380
Hills covered with purple flowers.
Stone structures by ancient people.

00:01:01.580 --> 00:01:04.480
Magnificent rocks carved by glaciers.

00:01:05.380 --> 00:01:10.080
Have you forgotten all the familiar
scenery from our homeland?

00:01:14.190 --> 00:01:19.060
I can't believe it. My voice
is not getting through to Larva.

00:01:19.300 --> 00:01:24.870
I will wake him up. I will
wake him up with my secret spell.

00:01:32.710 --> 00:01:36.730
And the Japanese Shinma,
who stole my friend's soul...

00:01:36.950 --> 00:01:39.240
...I will destroy you all!

00:01:47.220 --> 00:01:48.950
We'll see the village soon.

00:01:49.530 --> 00:01:52.130
Finally, we get to meet
the western Shinma.

00:01:52.560 --> 00:01:56.890
I'm itching for a chance to show
what I can do. I will enjoy it.

00:02:06.080 --> 00:02:09.420
This is it. I remember this scenery.

00:02:20.660 --> 00:02:22.380
Larva...

00:02:58.430 --> 00:03:04.060
Shinma are supernatural beings
that devour the hearts of men...

00:03:04.270 --> 00:03:08.500
...and lead them to ruin.

00:03:09.100 --> 00:03:14.510
Long ago, they were sealed
in the Dark World.

00:03:14.710 --> 00:03:18.910
However, there are stray Shinma
that live secretly...

00:03:19.110 --> 00:03:22.050
...in the human world.

00:03:22.450 --> 00:03:25.910
They lurk in the division
between night and day.

00:03:26.860 --> 00:03:32.560
The Guardian who sends the stray
Shinma back to the Dark World...

00:03:32.760 --> 00:03:38.260
...is the beautiful vampire, Miyu.

00:03:38.470 --> 00:03:42.430
No one knows her true face.

00:04:20.780 --> 00:04:24.070
- Strange...
- Something is wrong.

00:04:24.280 --> 00:04:27.440
I used to sleep in the cape
outside the village.

00:04:27.650 --> 00:04:32.750
I knew how the villagers were doing.
It didn't used to be this quiet.

00:04:41.400 --> 00:04:44.660
Japan. It's a poor country.

00:04:44.870 --> 00:04:47.330
It's too poor for me to take over.

00:04:47.540 --> 00:04:49.770
Don't be quick to judge.

00:04:50.410 --> 00:04:52.700
Welcome, western Shinma.

00:04:52.910 --> 00:04:56.340
But I will not let you go
forward from this point on.

00:04:57.110 --> 00:04:59.910
What a little brat.
A Japanese Shinma?

00:05:00.620 --> 00:05:02.310
I'm the Guardian.

00:05:04.320 --> 00:05:06.510
Nothing has changed since then.

00:05:06.720 --> 00:05:09.380
I don't get it. Why are there
no sign of humans?

00:05:09.590 --> 00:05:12.220
Miyu, something is approaching!

00:05:45.190 --> 00:05:49.720
You fell into our trap so easily,
Japanese Shinmas.

00:05:50.330 --> 00:05:52.990
It was you who sent him to us.

00:05:53.740 --> 00:05:57.000
That's correct.
The Honorable Garline is upset.

00:05:57.340 --> 00:06:01.210
You tied Larva to this land.
We'll have to kill you for that.

00:06:01.410 --> 00:06:03.880
I see. I was just being used!

00:06:04.610 --> 00:06:06.480
You finally figured it out.

00:06:06.680 --> 00:06:11.140
We planted a death crystal in you
and sent you to the Guardian.

00:06:11.350 --> 00:06:14.980
Your duty is done.
We don't even need to kill you.

00:06:15.190 --> 00:06:20.020
The death crystal will kill you.
But I can show mercy...

00:06:20.600 --> 00:06:22.460
...and kill you right now!

00:06:22.770 --> 00:06:25.270
Nami, create a barrier!

00:06:31.670 --> 00:06:33.800
Where did you take Larva?

00:06:34.010 --> 00:06:37.240
The Honorable Garline is casting
a revival spell.

00:06:37.450 --> 00:06:42.470
He will be awakened soon
and the tie with you will be over.

00:06:42.680 --> 00:06:47.780
That's not how it is with me and Larva.
Larva and I share a destiny.

00:06:48.460 --> 00:06:49.860
Nonsense!

00:06:57.530 --> 00:07:00.020
You cannot burn my body!

00:07:00.640 --> 00:07:02.500
Miyu, this guy!

00:07:09.510 --> 00:07:10.700
Miyu!

00:07:20.590 --> 00:07:22.350
I did it!

00:07:27.300 --> 00:07:28.990
Let me take care of it.

00:07:30.900 --> 00:07:32.760
Blizzard!

00:07:52.960 --> 00:07:56.920
Barrow was...
I can't make light of her.

00:08:08.370 --> 00:08:11.460
It's tricky.
They are being manipulated.

00:08:11.870 --> 00:08:14.360
Shall I handle this too?

00:08:14.580 --> 00:08:16.940
No! Not these people.

00:08:17.450 --> 00:08:19.640
It's okay.
Just go to the ghost ship.

00:08:19.880 --> 00:08:22.370
Your dear servant is waiting,
isn't he?

00:08:22.780 --> 00:08:25.340
No more discussion!

00:08:38.800 --> 00:08:40.530
Let's go.

00:08:44.140 --> 00:08:45.800
That is fine.

00:08:46.010 --> 00:08:49.410
We want a piece of the Shinma too.

00:09:18.540 --> 00:09:23.440
I stopped by this island, and
I'm pleasantly surprised to meet you.

00:09:23.810 --> 00:09:28.480
- Do I make you want to leave quietly?
- No, I'm enjoying this.

00:09:28.820 --> 00:09:32.510
I will float your dead body
in this ocean.

00:09:32.720 --> 00:09:35.280
That might happen to you.

00:09:40.860 --> 00:09:44.230
- Larva...
- How will we get onto that ship?

00:09:45.130 --> 00:09:47.460
We have to cross here.

00:09:55.640 --> 00:09:56.700
Death crystal!

00:09:56.910 --> 00:10:00.940
Damn! How much more are they
gonna get in our way?

00:10:05.750 --> 00:10:08.720
- Miyu, you will save Ryu, won't you?
- Yes.

00:10:09.360 --> 00:10:13.760
Please, you must destroy
the western Shinmas.

00:10:20.470 --> 00:10:22.660
I don't have any more power left.

00:10:22.870 --> 00:10:26.770
Hurry! Before I can no longer
take it!

00:10:30.650 --> 00:10:32.910
Can I trust Miyu?

00:10:33.120 --> 00:10:37.560
She is not going to betray you.
I can tell.

00:10:39.860 --> 00:10:42.160
I leave the rest to you, Miyu.

00:10:52.830 --> 00:10:56.200
I don't like it. I feel as if
my every move is being tracked.

00:10:58.310 --> 00:11:00.640
So I heard you are the Guardian.

00:11:00.840 --> 00:11:03.900
I give you credit
for making it this far.

00:11:04.110 --> 00:11:05.870
But you will die here.

00:11:06.310 --> 00:11:07.800
Return Larva to me!

00:11:08.020 --> 00:11:10.510
Larva was originally a western Shinma.

00:11:10.720 --> 00:11:13.480
He was simply spending
his transient days here.

00:11:13.690 --> 00:11:16.520
- When Garline wakes him up...
- That's a lie!

00:11:16.990 --> 00:11:21.520
I will follow you as long as you wish.

00:11:22.060 --> 00:11:27.300
Larva promised me he'd be by my side
forever. I came too late, didn't I?

00:11:27.670 --> 00:11:30.900
The promise is now over.

00:11:46.490 --> 00:11:48.050
Are you suffering?

00:11:48.260 --> 00:11:52.190
The more you suffer,
the happier Garline will be.

00:11:52.390 --> 00:11:56.760
I will mix that power in the potion
and give it to you.

00:12:02.300 --> 00:12:05.860
You must be made with
papier-mâché too.

00:12:09.810 --> 00:12:13.440
- I will reveal the real you.
- What?

00:12:14.520 --> 00:12:17.710
This fire is my anger.

00:12:19.790 --> 00:12:21.850
You love Larva that much.

00:12:22.460 --> 00:12:24.950
You won't understand until you die.

00:12:29.060 --> 00:12:33.860
I'll be reincarnated
with Garline's help!

00:12:38.110 --> 00:12:42.300
- Larva!
- Welcome to my ship.

00:12:44.480 --> 00:12:45.470
Larva.

00:12:46.080 --> 00:12:50.020
You are the Guardian?
You are pretty cute.

00:12:50.220 --> 00:12:54.780
But as might have been expected,
you defeated Barrow and Lilith.

00:12:54.990 --> 00:12:58.760
- What did you do to Larva?
- That's what I wanted to ask you.

00:12:58.960 --> 00:13:03.160
My friend won't wake up.
Did you bind him?

00:13:03.370 --> 00:13:06.100
I demand his soul back.

00:13:06.300 --> 00:13:10.600
I'm sorry, however, Larva will
never return to you.

00:13:19.750 --> 00:13:25.210
Larva is my servant and my friend.

00:13:26.990 --> 00:13:31.150
No, I should say he is me.
He and I have become one.

00:13:31.660 --> 00:13:35.120
Then I will cut you off.

00:13:38.500 --> 00:13:41.560
Come out, Child of the Sun!

00:13:48.580 --> 00:13:51.100
The sword of the death crystal.

00:13:51.310 --> 00:13:55.650
With even the slightest touch
on your skin, you will die.

00:13:58.190 --> 00:14:02.050
Can you feel the Child of the Sun
absorbing your power?

00:14:02.260 --> 00:14:05.590
Your power, I will take it
for my potion!

00:14:06.700 --> 00:14:09.170
Vanish, Japanese Shinma!

00:14:13.870 --> 00:14:15.700
What happened?

00:14:16.440 --> 00:14:18.170
A foreign zone.

00:14:18.370 --> 00:14:22.170
I thought the Child of the Sun
absorbed your power!

00:14:33.050 --> 00:14:36.850
The flute! Did you use it
to control Larva?

00:14:38.960 --> 00:14:43.830
No, it wasn't.
I told you we were one.

00:14:44.230 --> 00:14:46.700
I will not permit any more nonsense!

00:14:50.170 --> 00:14:51.690
Larva, wake up!

00:14:52.040 --> 00:14:53.840
Shut up!

00:14:55.410 --> 00:14:58.170
Larva! Larva!

00:15:12.860 --> 00:15:13.920
Miyu.

00:15:14.460 --> 00:15:18.920
I will follow you as long as you wish.

00:15:25.610 --> 00:15:30.410
You're getting tired?
You can no longer avoid my sword.

00:15:30.610 --> 00:15:36.570
Your life and fake tie,
I will finish them off right now!

00:15:38.620 --> 00:15:39.950
Get ready!

00:15:40.160 --> 00:15:42.760
- Garline!
- Larva!

00:15:49.500 --> 00:15:50.760
Larva!

00:16:06.480 --> 00:16:10.780
Why? Why me?

00:16:11.220 --> 00:16:15.450
Didn't Barrow give you the message
that your friend died?

00:16:15.760 --> 00:16:19.250
I didn't believe such words.

00:16:19.660 --> 00:16:25.190
It was at that very moment
that I died.

00:16:27.170 --> 00:16:30.160
I was reborn with
Miyu's immortal blood.

00:16:31.640 --> 00:16:34.770
Our blood combined.

00:16:41.920 --> 00:16:45.110
Then my blood flowed into Miyu.

00:16:46.550 --> 00:16:50.110
We were united
with each other's blood.

00:16:50.530 --> 00:16:55.400
But when I learned the truth
about Miyu's cursed destiny...

00:16:55.600 --> 00:16:57.460
...and her sorrows...

00:16:57.800 --> 00:17:02.030
...I chose on my own to stay
beside her.

00:17:02.500 --> 00:17:06.630
If or when I want to break away
from this circle of destiny...

00:17:06.980 --> 00:17:10.220
...I want you to cut it off for me.

00:17:10.410 --> 00:17:12.000
I promise.

00:17:12.480 --> 00:17:16.970
I will follow you as long as you wish.

00:17:17.520 --> 00:17:21.320
When Miyu wishes,
I will terminate her life.

00:17:21.520 --> 00:17:27.220
Until then, I will not allow anyone
else to kill her. Even my friend.

00:17:30.170 --> 00:17:33.510
You still call me your friend.

00:17:34.300 --> 00:17:36.170
Garline.

00:17:36.370 --> 00:17:41.710
The one named Light of the Sea.
I shall never forget.

00:17:55.690 --> 00:17:59.890
Please allow the courageous one
death with dignity.

00:18:00.100 --> 00:18:03.100
Fine. I give permission.

00:18:30.260 --> 00:18:31.590
Miyu succeeded.

00:18:31.790 --> 00:18:35.460
See, I told you?
She kept her promise.

00:18:35.660 --> 00:18:37.220
Nami, together...

00:18:47.680 --> 00:18:49.210
- Larva.
- Yes.

00:18:49.410 --> 00:18:53.240
- Don't ever leave me alone.
- I'm sorry.

00:18:53.620 --> 00:18:56.490
It's okay now. Let's go home.

00:18:56.680 --> 00:18:58.950
- Miyu.
- What?

00:18:59.150 --> 00:19:02.090
Thank you for coming.

00:19:03.630 --> 00:19:06.300
I wouldn't have been
able to on my own.

00:19:06.490 --> 00:19:08.090
Ryu! Nami!

00:19:16.740 --> 00:19:18.760
Reiha, why?

00:19:19.310 --> 00:19:22.710
I simply helped them
follow their destiny.

00:19:22.910 --> 00:19:25.710
You weren't gonna let them go,
were you?

00:19:25.910 --> 00:19:28.610
There was no justification
to let them go.

00:19:28.880 --> 00:19:31.080
They assisted me!

00:19:31.890 --> 00:19:33.820
You are extremely lenient.

00:19:34.020 --> 00:19:36.490
They just didn't want to die.

00:19:36.690 --> 00:19:41.290
Stray Shinmas betray others without
hesitation. He attacked you.

00:19:41.700 --> 00:19:44.100
Don't you understand?

00:19:44.300 --> 00:19:46.530
You seem very displeased about it.

00:19:46.730 --> 00:19:49.330
Maybe we should settle
the matter now.

00:19:49.540 --> 00:19:52.990
You abandoned your duty
to rescue a western Shinma.

00:19:54.040 --> 00:19:57.980
It might be time for you
to step down as the Guardian.

00:19:58.410 --> 00:20:00.610
I am the Guardian...

00:20:00.820 --> 00:20:04.420
...and it's my duty to send
Shinmas back to the darkness.

00:20:04.820 --> 00:20:07.120
But you made me break my promise...

00:20:07.320 --> 00:20:09.760
...and I won't forgive you for that!

00:20:27.680 --> 00:20:30.280
Miyu, don't do it.

00:20:31.480 --> 00:20:33.240
Look what you did.

00:20:33.450 --> 00:20:36.850
Our conversation is over.
I'll let this incident pass.

00:20:37.050 --> 00:20:42.110
You are too weak right now.
But we will be enemies from now on.

00:20:44.630 --> 00:20:47.530
Be prepared, please.
We must say goodbye.

00:21:07.820 --> 00:21:12.350
Without us, you would have been
able to live quietly and secretly.

00:21:12.550 --> 00:21:16.390
But no one can escape
the circle of destiny.

00:21:37.680 --> 00:21:42.620
No matter where you go,
you two will be together.

00:21:46.420 --> 00:21:48.450
I won't forget.

00:22:07.610 --> 00:22:13.640
The door opens
And before me is eternity

00:22:13.850 --> 00:22:16.180
Whose voice calls me...

00:22:16.380 --> 00:22:20.320
...from so far away?

00:22:20.520 --> 00:22:23.150
Someone smoothes down my hair

00:22:23.360 --> 00:22:27.420
Who are you?

00:22:30.100 --> 00:22:34.090
My flute sings of a land
My heart so wishes for

00:22:34.300 --> 00:22:38.930
Where time and my feelings pass by

00:22:39.140 --> 00:22:43.410
- I don't want any friends
- That's a lie.

00:22:43.610 --> 00:22:47.880
- I don't even need myself
- It's the truth.

00:22:48.080 --> 00:22:52.070
Footprints I leave behind

00:22:52.290 --> 00:22:56.550
Washed away

00:22:59.260 --> 00:23:03.360
The night is mysterious
It conceals the truth

00:23:03.560 --> 00:23:07.800
Invited by the moon

00:23:08.000 --> 00:23:11.730
Darkness spreads through the sky

00:23:14.380 --> 00:23:20.910
The night is violet
Tears fall like rain

00:23:21.150 --> 00:23:28.080
The sky cries for me

00:23:35.260 --> 00:23:41.290
The door opens
And before me is eternity

00:23:41.500 --> 00:23:43.830
Whose voice calls me...

00:23:44.040 --> 00:23:47.970
...from so far away?

00:23:48.180 --> 00:23:50.800
Someone smoothes down my hair

00:23:51.010 --> 00:23:55.070
Who are you?

00:23:57.750 --> 00:24:01.740
My flute sings of a land
My heart so wishes for

00:24:01.960 --> 00:24:06.590
Where time and my feelings pass by

00:24:06.790 --> 00:24:11.060
