- That's a lie.

00:24:11.270 --> 00:24:15.540
- I don't even need myself
- It's the truth.

00:24:15.740 --> 00:24:19.730
Footprints I leave behind

00:24:19.940 --> 00:24:24.210
Washed away

00:24:26.910 --> 00:24:31.010
The night is mysterious
It conceals the truth

00:24:31.220 --> 00:24:35.450
Invited by the moon

00:24:35.660 --> 00:24:39.390
Darkness spreads through the sky

00:24:42.030 --> 00:24:48.560
The night is violet
Tears fall like rain

00:24:48.800 --> 00:24:55.730
The sky cries for me

00:25:00.280 --> 00:25:03.480
Sometimes passion is
too intense and not accepted.

00:25:03.650 --> 00:25:04.640
AQUARIUM

00:25:04.820 --> 00:25:08.480
A young man commits his feelings
to a sleeping mermaid.

00:25:08.920 --> 00:25:12.760
The mermaid, in return,
showed him beautiful dreams.

00:25:12.960 --> 00:25:17.790
Their brief happy time together
soon saw the darkness of the night.

00:25:18.570 --> 00:25:22.930
Next on Vampire Princess Miyu,
"Dream of the Mermaid."

00:25:23.140 --> 00:25:27.370
An illusion floats
in the blue water.
